repository-code: "https://github.com/Ryo-wtnb11/racah"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Rust library for Racah-Wigner calculus: Clebsch-Gordan and recoupling
  (F/R) coefficients for SU(2), SU(N), SO(N), and Sp(2N), computed on demand
  for any admissible labels under a gauge frozen as a normative specification,
  with Python bindings.
